%% Approval Workflow lifecycle flow
%% Shows request progression with escalation and decision completion.
flowchart LR
    Submit[Request Submission]
    Evaluate[Policy Evaluation]
    Route[Approver Routing]
    Decide[Decision Step]
    Escalate[Escalation Path]
    Finalize[Finalization and Callback]

    Submit --> Evaluate --> Route --> Decide --> Finalize
    Route -->|Timeout| Escalate --> Route
    Decide -->|Needs Revision| Submit
